			"Message": "docs(Sky): Standardize emoji placement and refine ecosystem diagram labels\n\nAdjust the positioning of the '🌌' emoji in the README to follow the section titles rather than precede them, ensuring consistent visual hierarchy across the 'Sky in the Land Ecosystem' section. Similarly, reposition the '🍃', '📱', '⛰️', and '📦' emojis in the Mermaid diagram subgraph labels to appear after the descriptive text.\n\nUpdate the 'Funding & Acknowledgements' section to reflect the new emoji placement convention and fix a minor grammatical flow where the emoji was splitting the sentence subject and verb.\n\nThese changes improve the typographic consistency and readability of the documentation without altering any architectural descriptions.",
